       <string>蒙皮（Loft 放样）</string>
      </property>
     </item>
    </widget>
   </item>
   <item>
    <widget class="QLabel" name="labelMethodDesc">
     <property name="text">
      <string>贪婪三角化将局部邻域投影到切平面并连接，速度快，适合叶片等单侧扫描的开放曲面。</string>
     </property>
     <property name="wordWrap">
      <bool>true</bool>
     </property>
     <property name="styleSheet">
      <string notr="true">color: #555; padding: 6px; background: #f5f5f5; border-radius: 4px;</string>
     </property>
    </widget>
   </item>
   <item>
    <widget class="QGroupBox" name="groupBoxMesh">
     <property name="title">
      <string>Mesh 参数</string>
     </property>
     <property name="styleSheet">
      <string notr="true">QGroupBox { font-weight: bold; }</string>
     </property>
     <layout class="QFormLayout" name="formLayoutMesh">
      <property name="labelAlignment">
       <set>Qt::AlignRight|Qt::AlignTrailing|Qt::AlignVCenter</set>
      </property>
      <property name="formAlignment">
       <set>Qt::AlignHCenter|Qt::AlignTop</set>
      </property>
      <property name="horizontalSpacing">
       <number>12</number>
      </property>
      <property name="verticalSpacing">
       <number>6</number>
      </property>
      <item row="0" column="0">
       <widget class="QLabel" name="labelVoxel">
        <property name="text">
         <string>体素叶大小</string>
        </property>
       </widget>
      </item>
      <item row="0" column="1">
       <widget class="QDoubleSpinBox" name="spinBoxVoxel">
        <property name="suffix">
         <string> mm</string>
        </property>
        <property name="decimals">
         <number>1</number>
        </property>
        <property name="minimum">
         <double>0.100000000000000</double>
        </property>
        <property name="maximum">
         <double>10.000000000000000</double>
        </property>
        <property name="singleStep">
         <double>0.100000000000000</double>
        </property>
        <property name="stepType">
         <enum>QAbstractSpinBox::DefaultStepType</enum>
        </property>
        <property name="value">
         <double>0.500000000000000</double>
        </property>
        <property name="toolTip">
         <string>重建前对点云进行下采样的 3D 网格单元尺寸。值越小保留的细节越多，但计算量更大、对噪声更敏感；值越大速度越快但网格越粗糙。</string>
        </property>
       </widget>
      </item>
      <item row="1" column="0">
       <widget class="QLabel" name="labelAngle">
        <property name="text">
         <string>最大曲面角度</string>
        </property>
       </widget>
      </item>
      <item row="1" column="1">
       <widget class="QDoubleSpinBox" name="spinBoxMaxAngle">
        <property name="suffix">
         <string>°</string>
        </property>
        <property name="decimals">
         <number>0</number>
        </property>
        <property name="minimum">
         <double>10.000000000000000</double>
        </property>
        <property name="maximum">
         <double>120.000000000000000</double>
        </property>
        <property name="singleStep">
         <double>5.000000000000000</double>
        </property>
        <property name="value">
         <double>45.000000000000000</double>
        </property>
        <property name="toolTip">
         <string>相邻点法线之间仍被视为同一曲面的最大角度（度）。值越低强制更平滑的连接，有助于剔除尖锐伪影；值越高允许更锋利的边缘通过。</string>
        </property>
       </widget>
      </item>
     </layout>
    </widget>
   </item>
   <item>
    <widget class="QGroupBox" name="groupBoxPoisson">
     <property name="title">
      <string>Poisson 参数</string>
     </property>
     <property name="styleSheet">
      <string notr="true">QGroupBox { font-weight: bold; }</string>
     </property>
     <layout class="QFormLayout" name="formLayoutPoisson">
      <property name="labelAlignment">
       <set>Qt::AlignRight|Qt::AlignTrailing|Qt::AlignVCenter</set>
      </property>
      <property name="horizontalSpacing">
       <number>12</number>
      </property>
      <property name="verticalSpacing">
       <number>6</number>
      </property>
      <item row="0" column="0">
       <widget class="QLabel" name="labelPoissonDepth">
        <property name="text">
         <string>八叉树深度</string>
        </property>
       </widget>
      </item>
      <item row="0" column="1">
       <widget class="QSpinBox" name="spinBoxPoissonDepth">
        <property name="minimum">
         <number>5</number>
        </property>
        <property name="maximum">
         <number>12</number>
        </property>
        <property name="value">
         <number>8</number>
        </property>
        <property name="toolTip">
         <string>Poisson 重建所用八叉树的最大深度。每增加 1 级空间分辨率翻倍（8 级 ≈ 256³ 体素）。值越高细节越多，但内存和时间呈指数增长。</string>
        </property>
       </widget>
      </item>
      <item row="1" column="0">
       <widget class="QLabel" name="labelPoissonSolverDivide">
        <property name="text">
         <string>求解器细分</string>
        </property>
       </widget>
      </item>
      <item row="1" column="1">
       <widget class="QSpinBox" name="spinBoxPoissonSolverDivide">
        <property name="minimum">
         <number>3</number>
        </property>
        <property name="maximum">
         <number>10</number>
        </property>
        <property name="value">
         <number>5</number>
        </property>
        <property name="toolTip">
         <string>线性系统求解器的子网格采样因子（Gauss-Seidel 多重网格松弛参数）。值越高在更细的子网格上优化解，提高收敛精度，但求解时间更长。</string>
        </property>
       </widget>
      </item>
      <item row="2" column="0">
       <widget class="QLabel" name="labelPoissonIsoDivide">
        <property name="text">
         <string>等值面细分</string>
        </property>
       </widget>
      </item>
      <item row="2" column="1">
       <widget class="QSpinBox" name="spinBoxPoissonIsoDivide">
        <property name="minimum">
         <number>3</number>
        </property>
        <property name="maximum">
         <number>10</number>
        </property>
        <property name="value">
         <number>5</number>
        </property>
        <property name="toolTip">
         <string>Marching cubes 等值面提取的子采样因子。值越高以更细的分辨率采样隐式曲面，输出网格更密、更光滑。</string>
        </property>
       </widget>
      </item>
     </layout>
    </widget>
   </item>
   <item>
    <widget class="QGroupBox" name="groupBoxNurbs">
     <property name="title">
      <string>NURBS 参数</string>
     </property>
     <property name="styleSheet">
      <string notr="true">QGroupBox { font-weight: bold; }</string>
     </property>
     <layout class="QFormLayout" name="formLayoutNurbs">
      <property name="labelAlignment">
       <set>Qt::AlignRight|Qt::AlignTrailing|Qt::AlignVCenter</set>
      </property>
      <property name="horizontalSpacing">
       <number>12</number>
      </property>
      <property name="verticalSpacing">
       <number>6</number>
      </property>
      <item row="0" column="0">
       <widget class="QLabel" name="labelNurbsOrder">
        <property name="text">
         <string>阶数</string>
        </property>
       </widget>
      </item>
      <item row="0" column="1">
       <widget class="QSpinBox" name="spinBoxNurbsOrder">
        <property name="minimum">
         <number>2</number>
        </property>
        <property name="maximum">
         <number>6</number>
        </property>
        <property name="value">
         <number>3</number>
        </property>
        <property name="toolTip">
         <string>NURBS 曲面的多项式阶数（次数+1）。阶数 3（二次曲面）最常用——光滑且数值稳定。阶数越高曲面越平滑，但在噪声数据上可能产生振荡。</string>
        </property>
       </widget>
      </item>
      <item row="1" column="0">
       <widget class="QLabel" name="labelNurbsRefinement">
        <property name="text">
         <string>细化迭代</string>
        </property>
       </widget>
      </item>
      <item row="1" column="1">
       <widget class="QSpinBox" name="spinBoxNurbsRefinement">
        <property name="minimum">
         <number>1</number>
        </property>
        <property name="maximum">
         <number>20</number>
        </property>
        <property name="value">
         <number>5</number>
        </property>
        <property name="toolTip">
         <string>NURBS 拟合过程中迭代优化（组装+求解）的次数。每次迭代优化控制点位置以更好地逼近输入点云。迭代越多拟合越紧密，但耗时成正比增加。</string>
        </property>
       </widget>
      </item>
      <item row="2" column="0">
       <widget class="QLabel" name="labelNurbsResolution">
        <property name="text">
         <string>采样分辨率</string>
        </property>
       </widget>
      </item>
      <item row="2" column="1">
       <widget class="QSpinBox" name="spinBoxNurbsResolution">
        <property name="minimum">
         <number>16</number>
        </property>
        <property name="maximum">
         <number>256</number>
        </property>
        <property name="value">
         <number>64</number>
        </property>
        <property name="toolTip">
         <string>将拟合后的 NURBS 曲面三角化为网格时，每个参数方向上的采样点数。值越高输出网格越密越光滑（64 → 4096 个面片；256 → 65536 个面片）。</string>
        </property>
       </widget>
      </item>
     </layout>
    </widget>
   </item>
   <item>
    <widget class="QGroupBox" name="groupBoxLoft">
     <property name="title">
      <string>蒙皮参数</string>
     </property>
     <property name="styleSheet">
      <string notr="true">QGroupBox { font-weight: bold; }</string>
     </property>
     <layout class="QFormLayout" name="formLayoutLoft">
      <property name="labelAlignment">
       <set>Qt::AlignRight|Qt::AlignTrailing|Qt::AlignVCenter</set>
      </property>
      <property name="horizontalSpacing">
       <number>12</number>
      </property>
      <property name="verticalSpacing">
       <number>6</number>
      </property>
      <item row="0" column="0" colspan="2">
       <widget class="QCheckBox" name="checkBoxMultiSection">
        <property name="text">
         <string>输入已是多截面格式</string>
        </property>
        <property name="checked">
         <bool>true</bool>
        </property>
        <property name="toolTip">
         <string>勾选（输入已是多截面）：
· 若在列表中多选了多片点云 → 每片作为一个截面；
· 若只选一片、但其内部已含多个分离截面 → 沿主轴按间隙自动切分成多个截面（截面数由数据决定）。
不勾选：对单个选中点云先沿主轴 PCA 均匀切片，再蒙皮（切片数见下）。</string>
        </property>
       </widget>
      </item>
      <item row="1" column="0">
       <widget class="QLabel" name="labelLoftSlices">
        <property name="text">
         <string>切片数</string>
        </property>
       </widget>
      </item>
      <item row="1" column="1">
       <widget class="QSpinBox" name="spinBoxLoftSlices">
        <property name="minimum">
         <number>2</number>
        </property>
        <property name="maximum">
         <number>500</number>
        </property>
        <property name="value">
         <number>20</number>
        </property>
        <property name="toolTip">
         <string>未勾选“多截面格式”时，对单个点云沿主轴切成的截面数量。勾选时此项无效。</string>
        </property>
       </widget>
      </item>
      <item row="2" column="0">
       <widget class="QLabel" name="labelLoftResolution">
        <property name="text">
         <string>每截面采样点数</string>
        </property>
       </widget>
      </item>
      <item row="2" column="1">
       <widget class="QSpinBox" name="spinBoxLoftResolution">
        <property name="minimum">
         <number>0</number>
        </property>
        <property name="maximum">
         <number>100000</number>
        </property>
        <property name="singleStep">
         <number>1000</number>
        </property>
        <property name="value">
         <number>0</number>
        </property>
        <property name="specialValueText">
         <string>自动</string>
        </property>
        <property name="toolTip">
         <string>每个截面均匀化+重采样后的点数。0=自动（取各截面点数中位数，上限1000）；手动设置可控制细节精度，值越大越精细但计算越慢。</string>
        </property>
       </widget>
      </item>
     </layout>
    </widget>
   </item>
